    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tiny turn-based tactical... <strong>soulslike</strong>! Explore a twisty, interconnected world, battle enemies using a unique spin on a 'posture' system, and employ various upgrades to your advantage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn-Based Soulslike Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternate turns with enemies in turn-based combat with a unique posture system. You have the option to attack directly, but can also deal damage by knocking enemies out of position, into walls, or even blocking their movement with your own body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512420/extras/e96d6cbd0d2cbb42fd61288107e93df0.poster.avif?t=1755460031\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512420/extras/e96d6cbd0d2cbb42fd61288107e93df0.webm?t=1755460031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512420/extras/e96d6cbd0d2cbb42fd61288107e93df0.mp4?t=1755460031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Countless Combinations of Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and discover equippable &quot;toolsets&quot; granting special abilities, &quot;modules&quot; to give various passive boosts, and weapons with unique shapes and hidden qualities.\u00a0 Customize your build as you explore and fight through the challenging terrain.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Twisty World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore six distinct zones through a sprawling, highly (and unpredictably) interconnected world.\u00a0 Unlock shortcuts, double back to find secrets of challenge difficult enemies, and uncover the hidden depths of this tiny but intricate world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512420/extras/597971251dbce2339b82aaaa9206d699.poster.avif?t=1755460031\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512420/extras/597971251dbce2339b82aaaa9206d699.webm?t=1755460031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512420/extras/597971251dbce2339b82aaaa9206d699.mp4?t=1755460031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master</strong> the unique turn-based combat by breaking enemy posture \u201cbuffer\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Untangle</strong> the dense, interconnected world with branching paths and unlockable shortcuts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight</strong> against unique roster of enemies, mini-bosses and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equip</strong> a variety of weapons and activatable \u201ctoolsets\u201d to manipulate enemy positions and turn order</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade</strong> your character\u2019s core stats and discover equippable \u201cmodules\u201d to give you special passive bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> a vibrant and atmospheric 16-color environments</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tiny turn-based tactical... <strong>soulslike</strong>! Explore a twisty, interconnected world, battle enemies using a unique spin on a 'posture' system, and employ various upgrades to your advantage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn-Based Soulslike Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternate turns with enemies in turn-based combat with a unique posture system. You have the option to attack directly, but can also deal damage by knocking enemies out of position, into walls, or even blocking their movement with your own body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512420/extras/e96d6cbd0d2cbb42fd61288107e93df0.poster.avif?t=1755460031\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512420/extras/e96d6cbd0d2cbb42fd61288107e93df0.webm?t=1755460031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512420/extras/e96d6cbd0d2cbb42fd61288107e93df0.mp4?t=1755460031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Countless Combinations of Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and discover equippable &quot;toolsets&quot; granting special abilities, &quot;modules&quot; to give various passive boosts, and weapons with unique shapes and hidden qualities.\u00a0 Customize your build as you explore and fight through the challenging terrain.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Twisty World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore six distinct zones through a sprawling, highly (and unpredictably) interconnected world.\u00a0 Unlock shortcuts, double back to find secrets of challenge difficult enemies, and uncover the hidden depths of this tiny but intricate world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512420/extras/597971251dbce2339b82aaaa9206d699.poster.avif?t=1755460031\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512420/extras/597971251dbce2339b82aaaa9206d699.webm?t=1755460031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512420/extras/597971251dbce2339b82aaaa9206d699.mp4?t=1755460031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master</strong> the unique turn-based combat by breaking enemy posture \u201cbuffer\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Untangle</strong> the dense, interconnected world with branching paths and unlockable shortcuts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight</strong> against unique roster of enemies, mini-bosses and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equip</strong> a variety of weapons and activatable \u201ctoolsets\u201d to manipulate enemy positions and turn order</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade</strong> your character\u2019s core stats and discover equippable \u201cmodules\u201d to give you special passive bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> a vibrant and atmospheric 16-color environments</p></li></ul>",
